---
import SectionHeading from '../ui/SectionHeading.astro';
import Button from '../ui/Button.astro';
import { site } from '../../data/site';
---

<section
  id="direction"
  aria-labelledby="direction-heading"
  class="scroll-mt-6 bg-white px-6 py-16 sm:px-10 sm:py-20 lg:py-24"
>
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-page items-start gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16">
    <SectionHeading id="direction-heading">
      Where we&rsquo;re going
    </SectionHeading>
    <div class="max-w-prose md:pt-3">
      <p class="text-base leading-8 font-medium text-ink/70">
        Starting in Chuka, we are growing toward a Zinduka Hub in more counties,
        beginning where talent has the fewest platforms.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-ink/70">
        If you speak for a community, a school or an organisation in another
        county and want to bring this space closer to home, get in touch.
      </p>
      <Button href={site.partnerHref} class="mt-8">
        Get in touch
      </Button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
